    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before time was counted and stars had names, gods descended from the heavens... not to worshipped, but to rule.&quot; In the shadows of forgotten galaxies and beneath the sands of Sumeria, the Anunnaki cosmic architects and celestial miners left their mark on Earth and beyond. They were not myth. They were visitors. Technologists. Tyrants. Teachers. You are the last awakened clone of an ancient Anunnaki overlord, reactivated from stasis to restart the divine harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap into cosmic planets on different maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine essence from dying stars and the Black Hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest the universe's resources to resurrect and click to Nibiru Planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clicks on the Black Hole give you Black Hole Points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you awaken the truth, or exploit it?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before time was counted and stars had names, gods descended from the heavens... not to worshipped, but to rule.&quot; In the shadows of forgotten galaxies and beneath the sands of Sumeria, the Anunnaki cosmic architects and celestial miners left their mark on Earth and beyond. They were not myth. They were visitors. Technologists. Tyrants. Teachers. You are the last awakened clone of an ancient Anunnaki overlord, reactivated from stasis to restart the divine harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap into cosmic planets on different maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine essence from dying stars and the Black Hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest the universe's resources to resurrect and click to Nibiru Planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clicks on the Black Hole give you Black Hole Points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you awaken the truth, or exploit it?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mine the Planets. Feed The Annunaki. Rewrite the fate of humanity. Anunnaki Clicker is a clicker cosmic idle game inspired by ancient Sumerian mythology.",
